 "intro_zh": "九华山，是以佛教文化、自然人文盛景为特色的山岳型国家级风景名胜区。景区内群峰竞秀，怪石林立，九大主峰如九朵莲花，千姿百态，各具神韵，构成了一幅幅清新自然的山水画卷。",
 "intro_en": "Jiuhua Mountain is a mountainous national scenic spot featuring Buddhist culture and natural and cultural scenery. In the scenic area, there are many beautiful peaks and strange rocks. The nine main peaks are like nine lotus flowers, each with its own charm, forming a fresh and natural landscape painting.",
